<div class="mw-parser-output"><h1>Frenzy</h1>
<p>Usage:
</p>
<pre>frenzy          (in a fight)
</pre>
<p>In a fight, a barbarian can throw themselves into a frenzy that grows 
every round they keep fighting: each round adds to their strength, for 
5 to 10 rounds by how well it took hold, and costs 10 endurance.
</p><p>The frenzy ends when the fight does, or when your endurance runs low, 
and leaves you tired. You need at least 100 endurance to start one, and 
starting it costs 30, even when it fails. A frenzy goes with rage and 
berserk.
</p><p>The Barbarians teach frenzy from guild level 70, to those with at least 
50 strength and 50 constitution.
</p><p><br />
See Also:
